WEBVTT

00:06:28.583 --> 00:06:31.851
They are paid what they have
the power to negotiate,

00:06:31.875 --> 00:06:34.643
and wages' falling share of GDP

00:06:34.667 --> 00:06:38.184
is not because workers
have become less productive

00:06:38.208 --> 00:06:41.375
but because employers
have become more powerful.

00:06:42.333 --> 00:06:43.601
And --

00:06:43.625 --> 00:06:45.208
(Applause)

00:06:47.167 --> 00:06:52.643
And by pretending that the giant imbalance
in power between capital and labor

00:06:52.667 --> 00:06:54.309
doesn't exist,

00:06:54.333 --> 00:06:58.059
neoliberal economic theory
became essentially

00:06:58.083 --> 00:07:00.333
a protection racket for the rich.